        "When destroyed, damages surrounding grass crops": "Khi b\u1ecb ph\u00e1 h\u1ee7y, g\u00e2y s\u00e1t th\u01b0\u01a1ng l\u00ean c\u00e1c c\u00e2y c\u1ecf xung quanh",
